| `selectedItems`     | `string[]`                  | {m.lv_listview_props_selecteditems_description()}                                             |
| `shape`             | `string`                    | {m.lv_listview_props_shape_description()}                                                     |
| `onSelectionChange` | `(Event, string[]) => void` | {m.lv_listview_props_onselectionchange_description()}                                         |
| `element`           | Dynamic                     | {m.lv_listview_props_element_description()}                                                   |
| `children`          | Only `ListViewItem`         | {m.lv_listview_props_children_description_prefix()} <a href="/">{m.lv_listview_props_children_link_text()}</a> |
| Element Attributes  | Dynamic                     | {m.lv_listview_props_elementattributes_description()}                                         |

