### {m.lv_listviewitem_props_title()}

| **Name**           | **Type**                       | **Description**                                                                               |
| ------------------ | ------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `as`               | `string`                       | {m.lv_listviewitem_props_as_description()}                                                    |
| `active`           | `boolean`                      | {m.lv_listviewitem_props_active_description()}                                                |
| `shape`            | `string`                       | {m.lv_listviewitem_props_shape_description()}                                                 |
| `value`            | `string`                       | {m.lv_listviewitem_props_value_description()}                                                 |
| `onAction`         | `(MouseEvent, string) => void` | {m.lv_listviewitem_props_onaction_description()}                                              |
| `onFocus`          | `(Event, string) => void`      | {m.lv_listviewitem_props_onfocus_description()}                                               |
| `role`             | `string`                       | {m.lv_listviewitem_props_role_description()}                                                  |
| `disabled`         | `boolean`                      | {m.lv_listviewitem_props_disabled_description()}                                              |
| `checkmark`        | `object`                       | {m.lv_listviewitem_props_checkmark_description()}                                             |
| `children`         | `Snippet`                      | {m.lv_listviewitem_props_children_description()}                                              |
| Element Attributes | Dynamic                        | {m.lv_listviewitem_props_elementattributes_description()}                                     | -->
